{"aliases":[],"ancestry":{"derived_from":[],"mutation_dimensions":["recipe_complexity","material_diversity","tool_requirements","skill_gating"],"observed_in":["cross-game design analysis"],"source_games":["broguece","cataclysm-bn","crawl","nethack"]},"concept_type":"design_primitive","concrete_examples":[{"description":"In NetHack, the crafting system is implemented through the use of the 'Spellbook' and 'Potion' mechanics, where players can combine various ingredients to create potions and other items, allowing for strategic decisions regarding resource management and exploration to gather materials.","game":"nethack","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7e5b-a659-dc0465421413","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1075-7dbf-a51b-c713e9c26615","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-787f-a72b-53ecd0e67e57","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7316-97a8-fb33968a55b8","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7a18-8a2f-a0684b6dd106","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-77be-843d-023b929be9dd","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7bac-b269-41b82a62a658","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-71d0-97c3-a2ceb6107f64","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7b6a-99c6-85f213529fdf","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7ff5-afc2-a68c3bd836c0"],"source_file":""},{"description":"In broguece, players can gather various materials from the environment, such as ores and herbs, which can be combined using specific recipes to create weapons, armor, and consumables. This crafting system encourages exploration and strategic decision-making about which resources to prioritize for crafting upgrades.","game":"broguece","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-026c-7e6b-a036-cc9dd7a859a5","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-025c-75eb-b046-a0b5cd3e87bb","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-023c-789f-bd54-277b32f37159","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-028a-7100-8af6-9a3e238ca420","urn:r